{"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"externalID":"s:10OpenAPIKit21DocumentConfigurationO","role":"symbol","title":"DocumentConfiguration","modules":[{"name":"OpenAPIKit"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DocumentConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration","symbolKind":"enum","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DocumentConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}]},"abstract":[{"text":"OpenAPIKit supports some additional Encoder\/Decoder configuration above and beyond","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"what the Encoder or Decoder support out of box.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DocumentConfiguration"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To instruct OpenAPIKit to decode OpenAPI Standards versions it does not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"natively support, set "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"userInfo[DocumentConfiguration.versionMapKey] = [\"3.5.0\": OpenAPI.Document.Version.v3_1_1]"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"That will cause OpenAPIKit to accept OAS v3.5.0 on decode and treat it as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the natively supported v3.1.1. This feature exists to allow OpenAPIKit to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be configured to parse future versions of the OAS standard that are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"determined (by you) to be backwards compatible with a previous version"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"prior to OpenAPIKit gaining official support for the new version and its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","t